{"root":{"data":{"id":"dm48mohnevc0","created":1791948221658,"text":"决策树"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48mtjb28w0","created":1791948232642,"text":"基本流程"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48mwlwtd40","created":1791948239330,"text":"目的"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48na9m2xs0","created":1791948269061,"text":"决策树学习的目的是生成一颗泛化性能强的决策树。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48nh10sew0","created":1791948283779,"text":"结束标志"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48nk37hdc0","created":1791948290442,"text":"当前结点样本全部属于同一类别，直接标记为叶结点；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48no17s8g0","created":1791948299028,"text":"属性集为空，或者所有样本在剩余属性取值完全相同，无法划分：叶结点标记为该结点样本中数量最多的类别；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48ns2fy140","created":1791948307810,"text":"当前结点包含的样本集合为空，不能划分。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48o32z3z40","created":1791948331786,"text":"算法核心"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48o66mn0o0","created":1791948338538,"text":"选择最优划分属性，不断划分提升结点样本的纯度"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48o91u2ls0","created":1791948344778,"text":"划分选择"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48ojtiw0w0","created":1791948368220,"text":"纯度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48on1xmqo0","created":1791948375259,"text":"分支结点所包含的样本尽可能属于同一类别，纯度越高。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48owxtqmg0","created":1791948396779,"text":"信息增益(ID3算法)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48p1dru1s0","created":1791948406450,"text":"信息熵Ent(D)","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48p7ils1s0","created":1791948419803,"text":"度量样本集合纯度最常用的指标"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48pjpfynk0","created":1791948446338,"text":"公式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48pn4yh9s0","created":1791948453806,"text":"Ent(D)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48pz1axeg0","created":1791948479707,"text":"值越小，纯度越高，比如说如果全是一类，值便是0，如果一半正类，一半负类。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48q6z2bgo0","created":1791948496985,"text":"信息增益Gain(D,a)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48qaigiw00","created":1791948504689,"text":"使用属性a划分数据集D带来的纯度提升。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48qhuo8q00","created":1791948520665,"text":"公式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48qmcgsq00","created":1791948530448,"text":"Gain(D,a)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48qtaysxc0","created":1791948545594,"text":"特点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48r4gwlew0","created":1791948569898,"text":"偏好取值数目多的属性，例如样本编号，会生成每个分支只有一个样本，泛化能力极差。ID3选择信息增益最大的属性作为划分属性。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48rhmtprk0","created":1791948598554,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48odcmbnk0","created":1791948354137,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48odxdvoo0","created":1791948355393,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48of2nu3s0","created":1791948357889,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}